&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt; Due to the nature of the anomaly, SCP-8839-J can be accessed from any foundation computer. Any attempt to access SCP-8839-J, however, is grounds for immediate termination in the most painful way possible. Any accidental activation of SCP-8839-J is grounds for the total deletion of all matter within 100km of the breach point. Any individual that survives SCP-8839-J is &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: line-through;&quot;&gt;to be afforded Class F amnestics&lt;/span&gt; to be put out of their misery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-8839-J is the &#039;light theme&#039; for foundation messaging system &#039;SCiPNET&#039;. Whatever entity or force of nature created SCP-8839 is, according to foundation analysis, in-human, and is likely more powerful and more evil than every other object in and out of containment, combined. SCP-8839-J is the most dangerous cognitohazard ever discovered, and as such is considered a &amp;quot;Class Φ Cognitohazrd&amp;quot;&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-520147-1&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;, the only of its kind. According to the SCPF IT help desk &amp;quot;SCP-8839-J can be activated by clicking the &lt;tt&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cognitohazard - Automatic Removal&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/tt&gt; button on your SCiPNET terminal, scrolling to &lt;tt&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cognitohazard - Automatic Removal&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/tt&gt; and clicking the button &#039;light theme&#039;&amp;quot;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:150%;&quot;&gt;&lt;tt&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ADDENDA&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-folded&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;+&amp;nbsp;I.&amp;nbsp;Effects&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;SCP-8839-J&amp;nbsp;event&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Close&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
