&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-block block-right&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-5314/Kip&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/scp-5314/Kip/medium.jpg&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot; alt=&quot;Kip&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-caption&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A family of SCP-5314 instances&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt; All SCP-5314 instances are contained in a medium-sized animal containment chamber at Site-66. The containment chamber must be observed at all times, to identify any anomalous events.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5314 refers to 127 anomalous instances of &lt;em&gt;Gallus Gallus domesticus&lt;/em&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-739272-1&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; of the &#039;&#039;Leghorn&amp;quot; race. SCP-5314 instances are sapient and demonstrate an ability to organize themselves as a society. All SCP-5314 instances follow the same religion and spend the majority of their time practicing it. Documents made by instances of SCP-5314 call it the &#039;&#039;Fellowship of the glorious egg&#039;&#039;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5314 instances engage in the following daily activities:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Praying, alone or in groups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Writing books. Stories vary in context but are usually about chickens that perform miracles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building small temples to offer to Their deity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Worshipping several objects inside their containment unit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5314&#039;s religion revolves around an entity designated as the &amp;quot;great egg god,&amp;quot; otherwise classified as SCP-5314-A. Although SCP-5314-A hasn&#039;t been observed, It is theorized that the entity has the capability to interfere with instances of SCP-5314 and their surroundings using SCP-5314-◇; however, the extent of its interactions remains unknown.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5314-◇ is the designation given to random events that can occur within the area populated by SCP-5314 instances. More observation is necessary in order to understand how SCP-5314-◇ manifests and its resulting effects on the SCP-5314 populace.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span&gt;Addendum 5314.1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;tt&gt;SCP-5314-◇ events&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-folded&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;▶OPEN&amp;nbsp;ADDENDUM◀&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;▷CLOSE◁&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;wiki-content-table&quot;&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Date&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Event&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Notes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;2019/02/22&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Clouds manifested inside SCP-5314s&#039; containment room. The cloud consisted primarily of urine.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Event repeats itself every two weeks. SCP-5314 instances hold festivals with every event.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;2019/03/11&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;A trash can manifested inside SCP-5314s&#039; containment room. Inside of it were several textbooks and a yearbook titled &#039;&#039;Jehovas school for the godly, 2017-2018&#039;&#039;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Research into the contents is ongoing&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;2019/03/28&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;SCP-5314 instances are seen worshipping for their god. An egg manifests above the instances&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;The egg is seemingly unbreakable, as SCP-5314 instances failed to catch it.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;2019/04/10&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;SCP-5314 instances are seen bringing offers to the egg. A large paint bucket manifests above the egg, covering the location in a golden yellow tint.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Around 44 SCP-5314 instances also turn yellow. Paint disappeared after about 3 months&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;2019/04/18&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;An SCP-5314 instance is born, as several SCP-5314 instances try to give gifts to the instance, several bolts of lightning strike the new-born instance.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;SCP-5314 instance miraculously survived&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;2019/06/02&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Several SCP-5314 instances crucify another instance on a cross, made of scraps of SCP-5314 houses. Cross repeatedly falls over, until it breaks.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;SCP-5314 instances try to beat up the crucified instance before foundation personnel intervenes.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;2019/10/19&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Winged eggs manifest around a dead SCP-5314 instance&#039;s grave. As the eggs try to sing, loud hip-hop music starts playing. this continues until the eggs break.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;After this event, SCP-5314 instances have become highly sensitive to modern hip-hop music.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;2019/11/01&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;A stop board manifests inside of the containment room. SCP-5314 instances start to worship it.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;No anomalous effects have happened since.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/snom&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5953932&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606575482&quot; alt=&quot;SNOM&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5953932)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/snom&quot;  &gt;SNOM&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnotes-footer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Footnotes&lt;/div&gt;
